1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,200
My toaster popped out a tiny championship belt.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:03,600
Not toast. A belt.

3
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:07,500
Inside: a boxing ring, the size of a coin.

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:11,200
Two bread slices, gloved up, circling each other.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,000
The crowd is made of crumbs. They're cheering.

6
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:18,600
A bell rings. Round two.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:22,500
One slice goes down.

8
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:26,500
The toaster dings like nothing happened.

9
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,800
White or wheat — who do you think wins?
